WEBVTT

00:01:28.500 --> 00:01:36.880 line:0%
[Melody of Golden Age]

00:01:36.970 --> 00:01:39.870 line:0%
[Episode 3]

00:01:40.680 --> 00:01:42.520 line:0%
Regarding the matter of the Ming Hall,

00:01:42.520 --> 00:01:45.450 line:0%
[Zichen Hall]

00:01:42.880 --> 00:01:45.450 line:0%
you have already punished yourself by forfeiting your salary,

00:01:45.450 --> 00:01:48.650 line:0%
and all the guards in charge have been severely punished.

00:01:48.830 --> 00:01:50.570 line:0%
The immolator has died,

00:01:51.200 --> 00:01:53.210 line:0%
leaving only a lonely elder at home.

00:01:53.680 --> 00:01:54.770 line:0%
This matter

00:01:55.089 --> 00:01:56.210 line:0%
is now over.

00:01:58.800 --> 00:02:00.980 line:0%
You just got married yesterday.

00:02:01.140 --> 00:02:02.600 line:0%
For the next few days, the morning reports

00:02:02.600 --> 00:02:03.760 line:0%
will be excused.

00:02:04.000 --> 00:02:05.600 line:0%
Stay at home and spend some quality time with

00:02:05.600 --> 00:02:07.030 line:0%
your new bride.

00:02:08.170 --> 00:02:08.969 line:0%
Indeed.

00:02:09.070 --> 00:02:10.080 line:0%
I heard that the Grand Commander

00:02:10.080 --> 00:02:12.360 line:0%
spent the whole night investigating the Ming Hall arson case

00:02:12.360 --> 00:02:13.720 line:0%
and didn't return home.

00:02:14.280 --> 00:02:15.720 line:0%
The Grand Commander is working

00:02:15.720 --> 00:02:17.520 line:0%
loyally and diligently for you.

00:02:17.720 --> 00:02:19.600 line:0%
It's just a pity for his bride.

00:02:20.040 --> 00:02:22.410 line:0%
Your Majesty, you should give the Grand Commander

00:02:22.410 --> 00:02:24.040 line:0%
a few days off.

00:02:24.040 --> 00:02:26.680 line:0%
I'm afraid his loyalty and diligence are just a pretext;

00:02:26.680 --> 00:02:29.540 line:0%
he's actually deliberately neglecting his bride.

00:02:29.879 --> 00:02:30.879 line:0%
I was the one who arranged

00:02:30.879 --> 00:02:32.740 line:0%
the Grand Commander's marriage.

00:02:32.920 --> 00:02:34.879 line:0%
This morning, when I went to visit,

00:02:35.160 --> 00:02:36.160 line:0%
I found that the bride

00:02:36.160 --> 00:02:37.879 line:0%
had actually run away in anger.

00:02:37.879 --> 00:02:39.200 line:0%
The entire Shen family

00:02:39.200 --> 00:02:39.840 line:0%
has no idea

00:02:39.840 --> 00:02:41.920 line:0%
where she has gone.

00:02:43.879 --> 00:02:45.830 line:0%
Could it be that the Young Lady of the Yan family,

00:02:45.830 --> 00:02:48.140 line:0%
who had just married into the Grand Commander's Mansion,

00:02:48.140 --> 00:02:49.840 line:0%
has disappeared?

00:02:51.800 --> 00:02:52.640 line:0%
Lord Lai,

00:02:52.850 --> 00:02:54.450 line:0%
how can you say such nonsense

00:02:54.560 --> 00:02:56.690 line:0%
in front of the Grand Empress Dowager?

00:02:56.920 --> 00:02:58.040 line:0%
Your Majesty,

00:02:58.400 --> 00:02:59.160 line:0%
Lord Lai

00:02:59.160 --> 00:03:01.480 line:0%
is just worried for the Grand Commander.

00:03:02.280 --> 00:03:03.400 line:0%
I heard that

00:03:03.520 --> 00:03:05.280 line:0%
you plan to grant more power

00:03:05.280 --> 00:03:06.920 line:0%
to the Imperial Security Bureau.

00:03:06.920 --> 00:03:08.530 line:0%
This is a good thing.

00:03:09.000 --> 00:03:10.660 line:0%
However, the Grand Commander

00:03:11.160 --> 00:03:13.290 line:0%
can't even manage his household well,

00:03:13.600 --> 00:03:16.280 line:0%
so how could he wield

00:03:17.480 --> 00:03:19.280 line:0%
such significant power for you?

00:03:21.000 --> 00:03:22.440 line:0%
Mr. Shen,

00:03:23.600 --> 00:03:24.900 line:0%
what do you think?

00:03:26.560 --> 00:03:28.710 line:0%
Minister Zhang is absolutely correct.

00:03:28.710 --> 00:03:30.240 line:0%
How can one manage a country

00:03:30.420 --> 00:03:33.020 line:0%
if they can't even manage their own household?

00:03:34.480 --> 00:03:35.520 line:0%
I'll go back now

00:03:35.600 --> 00:03:36.640 line:0%
to comfort my wife

00:03:36.760 --> 00:03:38.320 line:0%
and handle the household matters.

00:03:38.320 --> 00:03:40.520 line:0%
I won't disappoint your expectations.

00:03:42.640 --> 00:03:43.320 line:0%
It's not like you were

00:03:43.320 --> 00:03:44.600 line:0%
investigating the case the whole night.

00:03:44.600 --> 00:03:47.129 line:0%
Why did you go to bed without washing up again?

00:03:47.640 --> 00:03:48.480 line:0%
Could it be that

00:03:48.480 --> 00:03:51.879 line:0%
the Grand Commander really didn't enter the bridal chamber?

00:04:02.880 --> 00:04:04.210 line:0%
This Yan Xing

00:04:04.800 --> 00:04:07.540 line:0%
is your niece, right?

00:04:11.360 --> 00:04:12.880 line:0%
Your Majesty,

00:04:13.360 --> 00:04:15.430 line:0%
[Jinzang, Musician]

00:04:13.560 --> 00:04:14.630 line:0%
Yan Xing

00:04:15.320 --> 00:04:17.850 line:0%
is the daughter of Ms. Jin from the Yan family.

00:04:18.000 --> 00:04:19.069 line:0%
And Ms. Jin

00:04:19.600 --> 00:04:22.320 line:0%
is my elder sister.

00:04:26.360 --> 00:04:27.520 line:0%
Don't worry.

00:04:28.280 --> 00:04:29.640 line:0%
This Shen Du kid

00:04:29.840 --> 00:04:30.960 line:0%
looks rebellious,

00:04:31.120 --> 00:04:33.250 line:0%
but he's actually quite disciplined.

00:04:33.880 --> 00:04:35.640 line:0%
He won't really do

00:04:35.920 --> 00:04:37.520 line:0%
anything out of line.

00:04:38.560 --> 00:04:39.330 line:0%
Yes.

00:04:39.580 --> 00:04:41.650 line:0%
[Ximing Temple]

00:04:40.200 --> 00:04:42.459 line:0%
I'll personally visit Liang's Mansion.

00:04:47.090 --> 00:04:47.920 line:0%
You,

00:04:47.920 --> 00:04:49.120 line:0%
what are you here for?

00:04:50.480 --> 00:04:52.420 line:0%
[Xu Xiangren, Head Constable]

00:04:53.400 --> 00:04:54.360 line:0%
Director Wu,

00:04:54.640 --> 00:04:56.600 line:0%
I heard there's a case here.

00:04:57.520 --> 00:04:58.709 line:0%
There is a case,

00:04:58.959 --> 00:05:00.620 line:0%
but does it have anything to do with you?

00:05:00.620 --> 00:05:01.600 line:0%
I heard that

00:05:01.720 --> 00:05:03.280 line:0%
yesterday you got into the bridal sedan

00:05:03.280 --> 00:05:06.010 line:0%
and married into the Grand Commander's Mansion.

00:05:06.440 --> 00:05:07.080 line:0%
Why are you out here

00:05:07.080 --> 00:05:09.010 line:0%
wearing your wedding dress today?

00:05:09.690 --> 00:05:10.880 line:0%
Did you

00:05:11.160 --> 00:05:12.800 line:0%
get thrown out?

00:05:12.820 --> 00:05:13.600 line:0%
You...

00:05:15.160 --> 00:05:16.680 line:0%
This woman always causes trouble

00:05:16.680 --> 00:05:18.240 line:0%
when she's on duty.

00:05:19.320 --> 00:05:20.850 line:0%
Sixth Lady is sharp-minded

00:05:21.520 --> 00:05:23.680 line:0%
and has learned a lot of investigative skills from Chen Wen,

00:05:23.680 --> 00:05:25.400 line:0%
the supervisor of the Prison Department.

00:05:25.400 --> 00:05:26.280 line:0%
She has been

00:05:26.280 --> 00:05:27.940 line:0%
a great help to us constables.

00:05:28.000 --> 00:05:28.800 line:0%
That's right.

00:05:30.850 --> 00:05:32.380 line:0%
Director Wu, Commander Xu,

00:05:32.440 --> 00:05:34.040 line:0%
I was too impatient.

00:05:34.060 --> 00:05:35.300 line:0%
I apologize for the rudeness.

00:05:35.300 --> 00:05:36.640 line:0%
I came here just to see

00:05:36.640 --> 00:05:37.480 line:0%
if there are any clues left

00:05:37.480 --> 00:05:38.800 line:0%
at the crime scene.

00:05:39.320 --> 00:05:41.920 line:0%
There are specialized personnel for investigating cases.

00:05:41.920 --> 00:05:43.080 line:0%
As a scribe,

00:05:43.430 --> 00:05:45.120 line:0%
you should just take care of the files.

00:05:45.120 --> 00:05:46.300 line:0%
Why are you trying to investigate cases?

00:05:46.300 --> 00:05:48.320 line:0%
Go, go. Go back to the Ministry of Justice

00:05:48.320 --> 00:05:49.880 line:0%
and change your clothes first.

00:05:49.880 --> 00:05:50.840 line:0%
Director Wu,

00:05:51.720 --> 00:05:54.160 line:0%
you just returned from the western suburbs, right?

00:05:54.160 --> 00:05:54.959 line:0%
Sir.

00:05:58.690 --> 00:05:59.600 line:0%
Look.

00:06:00.000 --> 00:06:01.560 line:0%
This blue flower on Director Wu's sleeve

00:06:01.560 --> 00:06:03.640 line:0%
is so beautiful.

00:06:04.240 --> 00:06:05.240 line:0%
Look, look.

00:06:05.520 --> 00:06:06.240 line:0%
Looks like Ms. Wu

00:06:06.240 --> 00:06:08.370 line:0%
has learned a new embroidery pattern.

00:06:14.520 --> 00:06:15.280 line:0%
It's a good thing

00:06:15.280 --> 00:06:16.360 line:0%
that young people

00:06:16.360 --> 00:06:17.890 line:0%
want to learn and progress.

00:06:21.350 --> 00:06:23.350 line:0%
If you want to investigate the case,

00:06:23.920 --> 00:06:25.480 line:0%
go in and take a closer look.

00:06:25.520 --> 00:06:26.360 line:0%
But don't interfere

00:06:26.360 --> 00:06:28.120 line:0%
with the constables doing their work.

00:06:28.120 --> 00:06:28.920 line:0%
Also,

00:06:29.710 --> 00:06:32.570 line:0%
don't meddle in affairs that aren't your business.

00:06:33.410 --> 00:06:34.660 line:0%
[Ximing Temple]

00:06:34.160 --> 00:06:35.080 line:0%
What's going on here?

00:06:35.080 --> 00:06:37.040 line:0%
Wu's wife can't embroider at all.

00:06:37.280 --> 00:06:38.840 line:0%
His lackey, Feng Gui,

00:06:38.880 --> 00:06:40.480 line:0%
has been frequently visiting the western suburbs lately.

00:06:40.480 --> 00:06:41.959 line:0%
His legs are always covered in mud from the western suburbs.

00:06:41.959 --> 00:06:43.280 line:0%
He even gave him a property deed.

00:06:43.280 --> 00:06:44.400 line:0%
It's highly likely

00:06:44.560 --> 00:06:46.360 line:0%
he's been keeping a mistress in the western suburbs.

00:06:46.360 --> 00:06:46.959 line:0%
Mis...

00:06:48.520 --> 00:06:49.520 line:0%
Let's go.

00:06:52.120 --> 00:06:53.200 line:0%
I'm a scribe from the Ministry of Justice.

00:06:53.200 --> 00:06:54.240 line:0%
May I take a look?

00:06:54.240 --> 00:06:55.970 line:0%
If you're not afraid, go ahead.

00:06:56.120 --> 00:06:56.920 line:0%
Sir,

00:06:56.959 --> 00:06:58.440 line:0%
did you notice

00:06:58.440 --> 00:06:59.940 line:0%
anything unusual before?

00:07:00.280 --> 00:07:01.940 line:0%
I haven't found anything yet.

00:07:05.620 --> 00:07:06.360 line:0%
I heard that

00:07:06.360 --> 00:07:07.720 line:0%
when they were just dug up,

00:07:07.720 --> 00:07:10.180 line:0%
they were still tightly holding each other.

00:07:16.480 --> 00:07:17.370 line:0%
Both of them

00:07:17.440 --> 00:07:18.480 line:0%
had their hearts removed

00:07:18.480 --> 00:07:19.880 line:0%
and died from blood loss.

00:07:20.800 --> 00:07:22.460 line:0%
The woman's face was slashed,

00:07:22.800 --> 00:07:24.600 line:0%
but her expression is peaceful.

00:07:26.980 --> 00:07:28.720 line:0%
The man's body is intact,

00:07:28.720 --> 00:07:30.360 line:0%
but his skin has turned black.

00:07:30.360 --> 00:07:31.880 line:0%
From the scratches and bloodstains,

00:07:31.880 --> 00:07:34.080 line:0%
it seems the cuts were made after death.

00:07:34.840 --> 00:07:36.200 line:0%
In such weather,

00:07:36.910 --> 00:07:38.080 line:0%
their bodies actually

00:07:38.080 --> 00:07:39.720 line:0%
don't give off any foul odor;

00:07:40.060 --> 00:07:41.800 line:0%
instead, there's a fragrance

00:07:41.920 --> 00:07:43.560 line:0%
of mixed medicinal herbs.

00:07:43.760 --> 00:07:44.610 line:0%
Xing,

00:07:45.200 --> 00:07:47.170 line:0%
are you out of your mind?

00:07:47.560 --> 00:07:49.420 line:0%
How could a body have a fragrance?

00:07:49.420 --> 00:07:50.140 line:0%
Sixth Lady.

00:07:51.200 --> 00:07:53.000 line:0%
What you said is spot on.

00:07:58.080 --> 00:07:59.280 line:0%
This morning, a young monk

00:07:59.280 --> 00:08:00.040 line:0%
found the bodies

00:08:00.040 --> 00:08:01.160 line:0%
while digging for bamboo shoots

00:08:01.160 --> 00:08:02.720 line:0%
in the bamboo forest outside the temple.

00:08:02.720 --> 00:08:04.320 line:0%
We've confirmed that the man

00:08:04.360 --> 00:08:06.000 line:0%
is Liang Chenzhong, the eldest legitimate son of Mr. Liang,

00:08:06.000 --> 00:08:08.240 line:0%
the former Deputy Minister of the Ministry of Works,

00:08:08.240 --> 00:08:09.080 line:0%
and the woman

00:08:09.120 --> 00:08:11.200 line:0%
is Kuang Zhanxin, an entertainer from Pingkang House.

00:08:11.200 --> 00:08:12.590 line:0%
Could this be a case

00:08:13.710 --> 00:08:14.810 line:0%
of love suicide?

00:08:15.480 --> 00:08:16.280 line:0%
No.

00:08:17.200 --> 00:08:19.000 line:0%
The man's skin has turned black.

00:08:19.160 --> 00:08:21.200 line:0%
Have you found out what poison he was exposed to?

00:08:21.200 --> 00:08:22.250 line:0%
-The poison is...
-Zhong!

00:08:22.250 --> 00:08:23.250 line:0%
Zhong!

00:08:23.860 --> 00:08:24.800 line:0%
Zhong!

00:08:27.600 --> 00:08:29.080 line:0%
Zhong!

00:08:29.080 --> 00:08:30.960 line:0%
-My son!
-Madam Liang, my condolences.

00:08:30.960 --> 00:08:32.820 line:0%
Please, try to compose yourself.

00:08:33.200 --> 00:08:35.349 line:0%
Zhong!

00:08:34.109 --> 00:08:35.260 line:0%
[Liang Chenyu]

00:08:39.200 --> 00:08:41.400 line:0%
You were just talking about poisoning?

00:08:41.410 --> 00:08:43.140 line:0%
The poison your son was exposed to

00:08:43.140 --> 00:08:44.200 line:0%
is Water Dropwort.

00:08:44.700 --> 00:08:45.410 line:0%
[Madam Liang]

00:08:48.510 --> 00:08:49.840 line:0%
We, the constables

00:08:49.920 --> 00:08:50.800 line:0%
of the Ministry of Justice,

00:08:49.970 --> 00:08:51.630 line:0%
[Liang Jiren]

00:08:50.800 --> 00:08:51.840 line:0%
will definitely

00:08:51.840 --> 00:08:53.900 line:0%
get to the bottom of your son's death.

00:08:54.200 --> 00:08:55.720 line:0%
What's the use of that?

00:08:56.040 --> 00:08:56.840 line:0%
Liang.

00:08:57.830 --> 00:08:59.000 line:0%
Please forgive us.

00:08:59.740 --> 00:09:01.840 line:0%
I'm terribly sorry.

00:09:02.580 --> 00:09:04.000 line:0%
Mr. Liang, take care.

00:09:06.050 --> 00:09:07.650 line:0%
Are we still investigating?

00:09:11.150 --> 00:09:14.190 line:0%
Ximing Temple is a royal temple sanctioned by the emperor.

00:09:14.190 --> 00:09:15.520 line:0%
All the prominent officials and aristocrats in Xiang'an

00:09:15.520 --> 00:09:16.240 line:0%
come here

00:09:16.240 --> 00:09:17.500 line:0%
to pay their respects.

00:09:18.280 --> 00:09:20.210 line:0%
Now that such a thing has happened,

00:09:20.440 --> 00:09:22.050 line:0%
we naturally need to provide an explanation.

00:09:22.050 --> 00:09:23.000 line:0%
Yes, yes, yes.

00:09:23.520 --> 00:09:25.360 line:0%
After Madam Liang made a fuss,

00:09:25.360 --> 00:09:26.840 line:0%
my mind is in a mess.

00:09:28.880 --> 00:09:30.090 line:0%
Quickly investigate the case

00:09:30.090 --> 00:09:31.890 line:0%
and close it as soon as possible.

00:09:37.360 --> 00:09:38.240 line:0%
Lu Chuichui.

00:09:38.400 --> 00:09:39.200 line:0%
Yes.

00:09:39.840 --> 00:09:40.760 line:0%
Go.

00:09:41.080 --> 00:09:42.440 line:0%
Send the information we've gathered

00:09:42.440 --> 00:09:45.040 line:0%
back to the Ministry of Justice for archiving.

00:09:47.400 --> 00:09:49.960 line:0%
I heard that the abbot of Ximing Temple

00:09:50.040 --> 00:09:51.440 line:0%
has some fine tea hidden.

00:09:52.120 --> 00:09:53.050 line:0%
Let's go.

00:09:53.120 --> 00:09:54.750 line:0%
Let's mooch some of his tea.

00:10:01.640 --> 00:10:02.720 line:0%
He's going to drink tea?

00:10:02.720 --> 00:10:04.180 line:0%
How dare he drink tea?

00:10:04.600 --> 00:10:05.560 line:0%
Wu Taiming.

00:10:05.560 --> 00:10:06.760 line:0%
Sounds like "no peace."

00:10:06.760 --> 00:10:08.260 line:0%
All he does is throw his weight around.

00:10:08.260 --> 00:10:09.480 line:0%
What a bastard.

00:10:14.160 --> 00:10:14.960 line:0%
Xing,

00:10:15.200 --> 00:10:17.080 line:0%
you've been staring at the corpses for so long.

00:10:17.080 --> 00:10:17.720 line:0%
When you're done,

00:10:17.720 --> 00:10:19.040 line:0%
let's go together.

00:10:19.360 --> 00:10:20.080 line:0%
Wu Taiming

00:10:20.080 --> 00:10:21.640 line:0%
is going to enjoy tea.

00:10:21.640 --> 00:10:24.170 line:0%
We shouldn't shortchange ourselves either.

00:10:24.480 --> 00:10:26.600 line:0%
I'll take you to Furong Garden to watch a new play

00:10:26.600 --> 00:10:27.860 line:0%
and have some good tea.

00:10:28.480 --> 00:10:29.800 line:0%
Chuichui, you go back first.

00:10:29.800 --> 00:10:31.120 line:0%
I want to go to the corpse pit

00:10:31.120 --> 00:10:32.380 line:0%
and take a closer look.

00:10:33.000 --> 00:10:33.800 line:0%
Go ahead.

00:10:33.920 --> 00:10:34.720 line:0%
Alright.

00:10:35.840 --> 00:10:36.640 line:0%
I'm leaving.

00:10:40.640 --> 00:10:42.120 line:0%
Water Dropwort?

00:11:03.280 --> 00:11:04.000 line:0%
It seems you still

00:11:04.000 --> 00:11:05.800 line:0%
haven't remembered what I said.

00:11:10.400 --> 00:11:11.440 line:0%
How dare I?

00:11:11.440 --> 00:11:12.960 line:0%
Why did you come here

00:11:13.280 --> 00:11:15.410 line:0%
instead of staying in Shen's Mansion?

00:11:17.960 --> 00:11:19.720 line:0%
Although I've married into the Shen family,

00:11:19.720 --> 00:11:21.400 line:0%
I'm still a scribe at the Ministry of Justice.

00:11:21.400 --> 00:11:22.400 line:0%
A murder has occurred here.

00:11:22.400 --> 00:11:23.360 line:0%
How could I not come?

00:11:23.360 --> 00:11:24.200 line:0%
You're just a scribe

00:11:24.200 --> 00:11:26.360 line:0%
with no rank at the Ministry of Justice.

00:11:26.360 --> 00:11:27.240 line:0%
How come you've taken on

00:11:27.240 --> 00:11:29.100 line:0%
the responsibility of a coroner?

00:11:29.400 --> 00:11:30.960 line:0%
And I've never heard that

00:11:30.960 --> 00:11:32.200 line:0%
the Grand Commander of the Imperial Security Bureau

00:11:32.200 --> 00:11:33.600 line:0%
needs to personally put out fires.

00:11:33.600 --> 00:11:35.320 line:0%
For that, you even worked through the night

00:11:35.320 --> 00:11:37.120 line:0%
and missed the auspicious time.

00:11:44.160 --> 00:11:45.000 line:0%
Grand Commander,

00:11:45.000 --> 00:11:46.720 line:0%
I just asked the constables for the results of the investigation.

00:11:46.720 --> 00:11:47.800 line:0%
There's very little blood in the pit,

00:11:47.800 --> 00:11:49.000 line:0%
mostly corpse fluids.

00:11:49.000 --> 00:11:49.800 line:0%
Mr. Liang and Ms. Kuang

00:11:49.800 --> 00:11:50.520 line:0%
were likely transported here

00:11:50.520 --> 00:11:51.240 line:0%
after their blood

00:11:51.240 --> 00:11:52.400 line:0%
had almost dried up.

00:11:52.480 --> 00:11:54.160 line:0%
But there aren't any vehicle tracks nearby,

00:11:54.160 --> 00:11:55.560 line:0%
only plenty of footprints.

00:11:55.560 --> 00:11:57.240 line:0%
There are countless pilgrims who come here.

00:11:57.240 --> 00:11:59.160 line:0%
Even Princess Ying is a regular visitor.

00:11:59.160 --> 00:12:01.420 line:0%
What can you deduce from the footprints?

00:12:02.360 --> 00:12:04.240 line:0%
What about the shovel marks in the pit?

00:12:04.240 --> 00:12:05.680 line:0%
Can you determine when they were made?

00:12:05.680 --> 00:12:06.880 line:0%
It should have been some time ago,

00:12:06.880 --> 00:12:10.210 line:0%
but the coroner said it was hard to determine the exact time.

00:12:10.240 --> 00:12:11.570 line:0%
It was the 15th of April.

00:12:14.840 --> 00:12:15.800 line:0%
How do you know?

00:12:15.820 --> 00:12:18.200 line:0%
The edge of the pit is thin at the top and thick at the bottom,

00:12:18.200 --> 00:12:19.800 line:0%
with sharp drop-offs and rounded edges.

00:12:19.800 --> 00:12:21.640 line:0%
The murderer or the accomplice

00:12:21.640 --> 00:12:22.320 line:0%
must have used

00:12:22.320 --> 00:12:24.320 line:0%
a commonly used round-tipped shovel.

00:12:24.320 --> 00:12:25.080 line:0%
The soil at the bottom is compacted,

00:12:25.080 --> 00:12:26.840 line:0%
with the center being dense

00:12:26.880 --> 00:12:28.160 line:0%
and the surrounding soil loose.

00:12:28.160 --> 00:12:30.360 line:0%
This is typical of soil after rainfall.

00:12:30.400 --> 00:12:31.720 line:0%
Today is the 8th of May.

00:12:31.810 --> 00:12:32.880 line:0%
The last time it rained

00:12:32.880 --> 00:12:34.120 line:0%
was the 15th of April.

00:12:54.120 --> 00:12:54.920 line:0%
Here.

00:12:56.440 --> 00:12:57.480 line:0%
I picked them up

00:12:57.480 --> 00:12:58.840 line:0%
when I came out this morning.

00:12:58.840 --> 00:13:00.560 line:0%
When I get back, I'll ask the old housekeeper

00:13:00.560 --> 00:13:02.120 line:0%
which shop he bought such sweet preserved fruit

00:13:02.120 --> 00:13:02.840 line:0%
from.

00:13:03.560 --> 00:13:04.040 line:0%
Here.

00:13:06.720 --> 00:13:08.360 line:0%
Soil conditions can be quite variable.

00:13:08.360 --> 00:13:11.000 line:0%
Your findings might not be reliable.

00:13:12.530 --> 00:13:13.520 line:0%
Look here.

00:13:15.760 --> 00:13:17.520 line:0%
About 3 feet and 8 inches above the ground,

00:13:17.520 --> 00:13:18.650 line:0%
there's a soil mark.

00:13:20.840 --> 00:13:22.570 line:0%
It was caused by mud splashing.

00:13:22.840 --> 00:13:24.880 line:0%
The bamboo in Ximing Temple is yellow groove bamboo.

00:13:24.880 --> 00:13:25.760 line:0%
One day after rain,

00:13:25.760 --> 00:13:27.200 line:0%
it can grow 1 to 2 inches.

00:13:27.560 --> 00:13:29.460 line:0%
The splash mark is directly facing the corpse pit,

00:13:29.460 --> 00:13:31.160 line:0%
which is thick at the bottom and thin at the top.

00:13:31.160 --> 00:13:32.890 line:0%
It must have been made that day.

00:13:33.480 --> 00:13:35.540 line:0%
Chen Wen taught you these things too?

00:13:38.280 --> 00:13:39.040 line:0%
Honey,

00:13:39.040 --> 00:13:40.440 line:0%
I'm very attentive to you

00:13:41.040 --> 00:13:43.160 line:0%
and have investigated you thoroughly.

00:13:43.160 --> 00:13:44.560 line:0%
My Master once told me

00:13:44.560 --> 00:13:45.600 line:0%
that capturing the murderers

00:13:45.600 --> 00:13:46.520 line:0%
and bringing them to trial

00:13:46.520 --> 00:13:47.560 line:0%
is the responsibility of the Ministry of Justice.

00:13:47.560 --> 00:13:49.240 line:0%
Therefore, making every effort to solve cases

00:13:49.240 --> 00:13:50.520 line:0%
is the duty of every member

00:13:50.520 --> 00:13:51.120 line:0%
of the Ministry of Justice.

00:13:51.120 --> 00:13:51.760 line:0%
You're just a scribe

00:13:51.760 --> 00:13:53.240 line:0%
with no rank.

00:13:53.390 --> 00:13:54.850 line:0%
The responsibility of the Ministry of Justice

00:13:54.850 --> 00:13:56.760 line:0%
has nothing to do with you.

00:13:56.760 --> 00:13:58.300 line:0%
-I…
-We just got married yesterday.

00:13:58.300 --> 00:14:00.280 line:0%
Today, you should come back with me to Shen's Mansion

00:14:00.280 --> 00:14:02.160 line:0%
and learn what a wife should do.

00:14:04.120 --> 00:14:06.520 line:0%
The Grand Commander's Mansion hastily arranged the wedding.

00:14:06.520 --> 00:14:08.200 line:0%
Now, everyone in Xiang'an knows

00:14:08.200 --> 00:14:09.880 line:0%
that you don't like me.

00:14:10.000 --> 00:14:11.000 line:0%
And coincidentally,

00:14:11.000 --> 00:14:11.880 line:0%
I'm not

00:14:11.880 --> 00:14:13.680 line:0%
fond of you either.

00:14:13.720 --> 00:14:14.880 line:0%
So from now on,

00:14:14.880 --> 00:14:16.200 line:0%
we'll each go our separate ways

00:14:16.200 --> 00:14:17.240 line:0%
and not interfere with each other.

00:14:17.240 --> 00:14:18.480 line:0%
You don't need to worry about

00:14:18.480 --> 00:14:19.760 line:0%
what responsibility I should take on.

00:14:19.760 --> 00:14:20.890 line:0%
It seems that today,

00:14:21.920 --> 00:14:23.560 line:0%
I have to worry about it

00:14:23.560 --> 00:14:24.400 line:0%
after all.

00:14:26.680 --> 00:14:27.480 line:0%
Shen Du!

00:14:29.240 --> 00:14:30.120 line:0%
Let go of me!

00:14:31.480 --> 00:14:32.280 line:0%
Shen Du!

00:14:37.560 --> 00:14:38.640 line:0%
Put me down.

00:14:38.640 --> 00:14:40.240 line:0%
Shen Du! Shen Du!

00:14:41.080 --> 00:14:42.350 line:0%
What are you doing?

00:14:44.320 --> 00:14:45.380 line:0%
What are you doing?

00:14:47.120 --> 00:14:49.220 line:0%
Ximing Temple indeed deserves its reputation.

00:14:49.220 --> 00:14:50.240 line:0%
There's no such good tea

00:14:50.240 --> 00:14:51.700 line:0%
in the government office.

00:14:52.440 --> 00:14:53.440 line:0%
I'm unfortunate

00:14:53.600 --> 00:14:54.200 line:0%
to have married a wife

00:14:54.200 --> 00:14:56.200 line:0%
who is devoted to her official duties.

00:14:56.200 --> 00:14:58.160 line:0%
I can only take her back home for some intimacy.

00:14:58.160 --> 00:14:59.550 line:0%
Put me down now!

00:15:00.400 --> 00:15:01.670 line:0%
The scenery is not bad.

00:15:03.130 --> 00:15:04.800 line:0%
Shen Du, what are you doing?

00:15:05.400 --> 00:15:06.840 line:0%
Put me down!

00:15:07.960 --> 00:15:09.840 line:0%
Honey, you should be more obedient.

00:15:09.840 --> 00:15:10.640 line:0%
Otherwise,

00:15:11.350 --> 00:15:13.810 line:0%
I might have to show our affection in public.

00:15:16.200 --> 00:15:17.000 line:0%
That's...

00:15:17.270 --> 00:15:19.080 line:0%
That's... that Yan Xing?

00:15:19.120 --> 00:15:21.050 line:0%
And the other one on the horse is...

00:15:21.870 --> 00:15:23.130 line:0%
Grand Commander Shen.

00:15:31.240 --> 00:15:33.630 line:0%
Isn't it said that White Ghost

00:15:33.740 --> 00:15:34.560 line:0%
put a knife to Mrs. Shen's neck

00:15:34.560 --> 00:15:36.320 line:0%
to threaten her on their wedding day?

00:15:36.320 --> 00:15:38.120 line:0%
Looks like it's just a rumor.

00:15:39.240 --> 00:15:40.160 line:0%
Now,

00:15:40.440 --> 00:15:41.040 line:0%
you are already

00:15:41.040 --> 00:15:42.900 line:0%
Mrs. Shen in the eyes of everyone.

00:15:43.180 --> 00:15:44.580 line:0%
Since you're in the game,

00:15:44.680 --> 00:15:45.880 line:0%
there's no option

00:15:45.880 --> 00:15:47.010 line:0%
to leave unscathed.

00:15:47.620 --> 00:15:49.040 line:0%
A monkey in human attire.

00:15:49.720 --> 00:15:51.560 line:0%
Grand Commander, are you putting on this act

00:15:51.560 --> 00:15:52.800 line:0%
to gain a reputation

00:15:52.800 --> 00:15:54.480 line:0%
as a good husband?

00:15:54.920 --> 00:15:56.200 line:0%
We are newlyweds.

00:15:56.320 --> 00:15:58.450 line:0%
Naturally, we should stick together.

00:15:58.600 --> 00:15:59.400 line:0%
Today,

00:15:59.800 --> 00:16:01.000 line:0%
I will make sure you

00:16:02.000 --> 00:16:04.260 line:0%
and the people behind you are satisfied.

00:16:05.500 --> 00:16:07.160 line:0%
The Imperial Security Bureau is busy every day.

00:16:07.160 --> 00:16:07.960 line:0%
You must have

00:16:07.960 --> 00:16:08.920 line:0%
many affairs

00:16:08.920 --> 00:16:09.960 line:0%
to handle

00:16:09.960 --> 00:16:11.520 line:0%
for the Grand Empress Dowager.

00:16:11.520 --> 00:16:12.440 line:0%
I'm afraid taking me along

00:16:12.440 --> 00:16:14.170 line:0%
would be inconvenient for you.

00:16:14.900 --> 00:16:16.440 line:0%
Honey, are you dead or disabled?

00:16:16.440 --> 00:16:17.000 line:0%
Grand Commander!

00:16:17.000 --> 00:16:18.920 line:0%
Since you're neither dead nor disabled,

00:16:18.920 --> 00:16:20.780 line:0%
there's no inconvenience at all.

00:16:24.660 --> 00:16:26.520 line:0%
There's a letter from the palace.

00:16:28.760 --> 00:16:30.360 line:0%
Solve the Liang family murder case at Ximing Temple quickly

00:16:28.830 --> 00:16:32.620 line:0%
[Imperial Decree from the Grand Empress Dowager: Solve the Liang family murder case at Ximing Temple quickly]

00:16:30.360 --> 00:16:31.760 line:0%
and protect Liang Chenyu from the second branch of the Liang family.

00:16:31.760 --> 00:16:32.360 line:0%
No delays.

00:16:32.360 --> 00:16:33.280 line:0%
We need to go somewhere.

00:16:33.280 --> 00:16:33.960 line:0%
Where?

00:16:35.600 --> 00:16:37.030 line:0%
Liang's Mansion in the Fengyue District.

00:16:37.030 --> 00:16:40.090 line:0%
[Liang's Mansion]

00:17:00.450 --> 00:17:01.760 line:0%
What's the situation?

00:17:02.160 --> 00:17:02.920 line:0%
He's not investigating the case,

00:17:02.920 --> 00:17:04.379 line:0%
but I need to investigate.

00:17:04.480 --> 00:17:06.940 line:0%
I can't keep following him around like this.

00:17:08.280 --> 00:17:09.280 line:0%
Grand Commander,

00:17:09.629 --> 00:17:12.629 line:0%
our Third Young Master is waiting for you in the study.

00:17:21.110 --> 00:17:22.110 line:0%
Grand Commander.

00:17:29.730 --> 00:17:31.190 line:0%
If you don't call me Honey,

00:17:31.600 --> 00:17:32.950 line:0%
once we leave Liang's Mansion,

00:17:32.950 --> 00:17:34.810 line:0%
you can kiss your tongue goodbye.

00:17:46.130 --> 00:17:47.200 line:0%
Honey.

00:17:49.180 --> 00:17:50.040 line:0%
I'm listening.

00:17:55.790 --> 00:17:58.320 line:0%
We don't work in the same section.

00:17:58.840 --> 00:18:01.510 line:0%
You need to talk to the head of the second branch.

00:18:01.820 --> 00:18:03.920 line:0%
It's not very appropriate for me to follow.

00:18:03.920 --> 00:18:04.480 line:0%
How about

00:18:04.760 --> 00:18:06.060 line:0%
I wait for you outside?

00:18:09.350 --> 00:18:10.810 line:0%
I just want to go for a walk.

00:18:14.560 --> 00:18:15.360 line:0%
Alright.

00:18:16.360 --> 00:18:17.160 line:0%
Jing Lin.

00:18:19.240 --> 00:18:20.040 line:0%
Follow her.

00:18:20.040 --> 00:18:20.720 line:0%
Yes.

00:18:22.600 --> 00:18:24.530 line:0%
Grand Commander, this way please.

00:18:45.680 --> 00:18:47.460 line:0%
I haven't slept all night.

00:18:47.600 --> 00:18:49.210 line:0%
I need to take a nap here.

00:18:49.770 --> 00:18:51.700 line:0%
Go over there and keep watch for me.

00:18:56.280 --> 00:18:57.080 line:0%
Alright then.

00:18:57.640 --> 00:18:58.760 line:0%
Since you Imperial Guards

00:18:58.760 --> 00:19:00.160 line:0%
can even watch

00:19:00.160 --> 00:19:01.280 line:0%
the Grand Commander's wife sleep,

00:19:01.280 --> 00:19:02.720 line:0%
why should I be shy?

00:19:03.350 --> 00:19:04.950 line:0%
You can keep watch yourself.

00:20:08.760 --> 00:20:10.000 line:0%
Mrs. Shen?

00:20:10.080 --> 00:20:11.200 line:0%
Why are you here?

00:20:16.120 --> 00:20:16.920 line:0%
This is for you.

00:20:16.920 --> 00:20:17.850 line:0%
It's very sweet.

00:20:20.920 --> 00:20:23.440 line:0%
I heard that after the Liang family was split,

00:20:23.440 --> 00:20:25.010 line:0%
they built a wall between them.

00:20:25.010 --> 00:20:26.760 line:0%
The trees around here seem to

00:20:27.160 --> 00:20:29.000 line:0%
have been moved here later.

00:20:29.280 --> 00:20:30.240 line:0%
Logically speaking,

00:20:30.240 --> 00:20:32.400 line:0%
pear, mulberry, and locust trees

00:20:32.680 --> 00:20:34.560 line:0%
aren't considered auspicious choices.

00:20:34.560 --> 00:20:36.200 line:0%
The Second Madam had people move them here

00:20:36.200 --> 00:20:37.240 line:0%
when she went mad.

00:20:37.720 --> 00:20:38.980 line:0%
These trees symbolize

00:20:39.200 --> 00:20:42.400 line:0%
separation, subtle criticism, and a guilty conscience.

00:20:43.000 --> 00:20:46.400 line:0%
These two brothers must hold deep-seated grudges against each other.

00:20:46.400 --> 00:20:47.330 line:0%
Could it be true,

00:20:47.400 --> 00:20:49.160 line:0%
as the rumors say,

00:20:49.440 --> 00:20:51.280 line:0%
that the Water Dropwort poison that Liang Chenman,

00:20:51.280 --> 00:20:53.610 line:0%
the Second Madam's son, was poisoned with

00:20:54.930 --> 00:20:57.660 line:0%
came from the first branch of his uncle's family?

00:20:57.960 --> 00:20:59.280 line:0%
Don't say that!

00:21:00.720 --> 00:21:01.620 line:0%
However,

00:21:01.960 --> 00:21:02.680 line:0%
the Second Madam went mad

00:21:02.680 --> 00:21:04.720 line:0%
after the death of the Second Young Master.

00:21:04.720 --> 00:21:05.760 line:0%
Ever since,

00:21:05.800 --> 00:21:06.720 line:0%
the door between

00:21:06.720 --> 00:21:07.880 line:0%
the first and second branches

00:21:07.880 --> 00:21:09.040 line:0%
has never been opened again.

00:21:09.040 --> 00:21:09.520 line:0%
Madam!

00:21:14.780 --> 00:21:16.280 line:0%
Mrs. Shen, what are you doing?

00:21:16.280 --> 00:21:17.680 line:0%
I'm hiding from White...

00:21:20.720 --> 00:21:22.250 line:0%
I'm hiding from my husband.

00:21:23.320 --> 00:21:24.120 line:0%
Well...

00:21:24.390 --> 00:21:26.380 line:0%
Since I married him yesterday,

00:21:26.640 --> 00:21:27.480 line:0%
my husband

00:21:27.530 --> 00:21:29.440 line:0%
hasn't been willing to leave my side for a moment.

00:21:29.440 --> 00:21:30.880 line:0%
He sent someone

00:21:30.880 --> 00:21:32.740 line:0%
to follow me closely everywhere.

00:21:32.880 --> 00:21:34.800 line:0%
I really need a break.

00:21:34.800 --> 00:21:35.460 line:0%
Is White...

00:21:36.360 --> 00:21:38.360 line:0%
Is the Grand Commander that clingy?

00:21:41.640 --> 00:21:42.800 line:0%
So that's how it is.

00:21:42.960 --> 00:21:44.280 line:0%
I was actually wondering about it.

00:21:44.280 --> 00:21:45.800 line:0%
Though the Grand Commander often comes here,

00:21:45.800 --> 00:21:46.680 line:0%
this is the first time

00:21:46.680 --> 00:21:48.740 line:0%
he's brought a lady into the mansion.

00:21:49.080 --> 00:21:50.080 line:0%
My husband

00:21:50.120 --> 00:21:52.240 line:0%
is actually so close with the Liang family?

00:21:52.240 --> 00:21:53.840 line:0%
The Grand Commander and our Third Young Master

00:21:53.840 --> 00:21:54.880 line:0%
are very close.

00:21:55.000 --> 00:21:56.040 line:0%
He often brings

00:21:56.040 --> 00:21:57.000 line:0%
medicinal herbs

00:21:57.000 --> 00:21:58.460 line:0%
to the Second Madam Liang.

00:21:58.600 --> 00:22:00.160 line:0%
Something happened in the Second Madam's courtyard again!

00:22:00.160 --> 00:22:00.960 line:0%
Let's go!

00:22:01.000 --> 00:22:03.000 line:0%
It's the Second Madam's courtyard!

00:22:08.360 --> 00:22:10.120 line:0%
The Grand Empress Dowager has issued an order,

00:22:10.120 --> 00:22:11.080 line:0%
saying the design drawings for the improvements to the crossbows

00:22:11.080 --> 00:22:12.160 line:0%
must be completed on schedule

00:22:12.160 --> 00:22:13.020 line:0%
without delay.

00:22:15.480 --> 00:22:16.280 line:0%
But right now,

00:22:16.280 --> 00:22:17.760 line:0%
how can I focus on drawing?

00:22:19.840 --> 00:22:21.520 line:0%
Your brother Liang Chenzhong's case

00:22:21.520 --> 00:22:24.000 line:0%
is being investigated by the Imperial Security Bureau.

00:22:24.000 --> 00:22:25.240 line:0%
You can rest assured.

00:22:25.680 --> 00:22:26.480 line:0%
It's...

00:22:31.400 --> 00:22:33.960 line:0%
Your family has served in the Ministry of Works for generations

00:22:33.960 --> 00:22:35.360 line:0%
and is skilled in designing bows and mechanics.

00:22:35.360 --> 00:22:36.720 line:0%
Most of our country's military crossbow equipment

00:22:36.720 --> 00:22:38.300 line:0%
was designed by your grandfather.

00:22:38.300 --> 00:22:40.400 line:0%
That's how we've earned our reputation on the battlefield.

00:22:40.400 --> 00:22:41.600 line:0%
For this generation,

00:22:42.040 --> 00:22:42.840 line:0%
only you can

00:22:42.840 --> 00:22:45.840 line:0%
be entrusted with such an important responsibility.

00:22:47.680 --> 00:22:50.610 line:0%
The Grand Empress Dowager has always valued talent.

00:22:50.720 --> 00:22:52.000 line:0%
You just need to focus on completing

00:22:52.000 --> 00:22:53.400 line:0%
the task assigned to you.

00:23:10.080 --> 00:23:11.240 line:0%
Just like before,

00:23:11.680 --> 00:23:13.160 line:0%
every time my father picked up his brush,

00:23:13.160 --> 00:23:15.760 line:0%
your father would immediately turn and leave.

00:23:16.810 --> 00:23:18.470 line:0%
Before my father passed away,

00:23:18.480 --> 00:23:19.280 line:0%
he could never forget

00:23:19.280 --> 00:23:20.680 line:0%
what happened that year.

00:23:22.720 --> 00:23:24.570 line:0%
Shen Bingzhu

00:23:23.100 --> 00:23:23.890 line:0%
[Memorial Tablet of Shen Bingzhu, My Father]

00:23:24.880 --> 00:23:27.010 line:0%
deserves to be executed for his crime.

00:23:28.360 --> 00:23:30.360 line:0%
There's no need to mention it again.

00:23:30.800 --> 00:23:31.600 line:0%
Don't worry.

00:23:32.360 --> 00:23:33.240 line:0%
I won't repeat

00:23:33.240 --> 00:23:34.640 line:0%
that person's mistakes.

00:23:55.030 --> 00:23:56.000 line:0%
Man.

00:23:57.670 --> 00:23:58.520 line:0%
Man.

00:24:00.560 --> 00:24:01.560 line:0%
Man.

00:24:07.100 --> 00:24:08.720 line:0%
Water Dropwort?

00:24:11.800 --> 00:24:12.990 line:0%
Don't touch my Man!

00:24:14.680 --> 00:24:15.480 line:0%
Man.

00:24:14.770 --> 00:24:16.320 line:0%
[Second Madam Liang]

00:24:16.200 --> 00:24:17.000 line:0%
Man.

00:24:17.040 --> 00:24:18.280 line:0%
Don't touch my Man!

00:24:20.920 --> 00:24:21.720 line:0%
Help!

00:24:24.800 --> 00:24:25.710 line:0%
Help!

00:24:27.760 --> 00:24:28.680 line:0%
Help!

00:24:28.800 --> 00:24:30.460 line:0%
Grand Commander, over there!

00:24:31.520 --> 00:24:32.320 line:0%
Help!

00:24:35.080 --> 00:24:35.880 line:0%
Help!

00:24:39.800 --> 00:24:40.600 line:0%
Help!

00:24:48.300 --> 00:24:49.200 line:0%
Help!

00:24:55.230 --> 00:24:56.240 line:0%
Shen Du,

00:24:56.520 --> 00:24:58.020 line:0%
You're so vicious.

00:24:58.200 --> 00:24:59.040 line:0%
You can't drive me away,

00:24:59.040 --> 00:24:59.680 line:0%
so you're trying to take this opportunity

00:24:59.680 --> 00:25:00.920 line:0%
to let me drown here!

00:25:01.760 --> 00:25:02.640 line:0%
Help!

00:25:03.640 --> 00:25:04.440 line:0%
Help!

00:25:04.560 --> 00:25:05.360 line:0%
Here.

00:25:23.840 --> 00:25:24.960 line:0%
Clean yourself up.

00:25:29.080 --> 00:25:30.000 line:0%
Quickly escort the Grand Commander's wife

00:25:30.000 --> 00:25:31.400 line:0%
to bathe and get changed.

00:26:10.160 --> 00:26:12.490 line:0%
I apologize for any offense caused today.

00:26:13.320 --> 00:26:15.780 line:0%
Grand Commander, Madam, please forgive us.

00:26:16.040 --> 00:26:16.840 line:0%
It's alright.

00:26:18.200 --> 00:26:19.800 line:0%
Tell your Third Young Master

00:26:19.880 --> 00:26:21.560 line:0%
to focus on his task and not worry.

00:26:21.560 --> 00:26:22.360 line:0%
Yes.

00:26:32.840 --> 00:26:34.100 line:0%
I'll take my leave now.

00:26:50.830 --> 00:26:52.280 line:0%
If I hadn't seen it with my own eyes,

00:26:52.280 --> 00:26:53.280 line:0%
who would have thought that

00:26:53.280 --> 00:26:53.800 line:0%
White Ghost,

00:26:53.800 --> 00:26:55.520 line:0%
who strikes fear into people's hearts,

00:26:55.520 --> 00:26:57.200 line:0%
would actually be such a considerate husband?

00:26:57.200 --> 00:26:58.680 line:0%
He treats others coldly,

00:26:58.760 --> 00:27:02.090 line:0%
but in reality, he's a romantic husband in front of his wife.

00:27:06.120 --> 00:27:06.920 line:0%
What exactly did you say

00:27:06.920 --> 00:27:07.840 line:0%
to those maids?

00:27:19.920 --> 00:27:21.980 line:0%
I was just playing along with your act

00:27:22.040 --> 00:27:23.370 line:0%
of being a good husband.

00:27:23.800 --> 00:27:25.820 line:0%
Maids from such prestigious households

00:27:25.820 --> 00:27:28.560 line:0%
are the most effective at spreading rumors.

00:27:48.440 --> 00:27:49.520 line:0%
Why did you save me?

00:27:49.840 --> 00:27:51.000 line:0%
If I had drowned,

00:27:51.000 --> 00:27:52.440 line:0%
it would have been an accidental death.

00:27:52.440 --> 00:27:53.400 line:0%
You wouldn't have to find a way

00:27:53.400 --> 00:27:54.200 line:0%
to get rid of me.

00:27:54.200 --> 00:27:55.400 line:0%
Wouldn't that have been killing two birds with one stone?

00:27:55.400 --> 00:27:56.200 line:0%
You are still

00:27:56.680 --> 00:27:57.600 line:0%
useful to me.

00:28:00.340 --> 00:28:04.870 line:0%
[Shen's Mansion]

00:28:17.640 --> 00:28:18.490 line:0%
Madam,

00:28:18.520 --> 00:28:20.080 line:0%
I have arranged

00:28:20.080 --> 00:28:21.080 line:0%
your belongings.

00:28:21.560 --> 00:28:23.920 line:0%
You will sleep here tonight.

00:28:25.040 --> 00:28:26.320 line:0%
Didn't the Master say

00:28:26.360 --> 00:28:28.120 line:0%
that the main chamber shouldn't be used as a bridal chamber

00:28:28.120 --> 00:28:30.050 line:0%
because it might bring bloodshed?

00:28:30.280 --> 00:28:32.280 line:0%
The Master has already resolved it.

00:28:32.480 --> 00:28:35.000 line:0%
You can stay here with peace of mind.

00:28:36.600 --> 00:28:37.520 line:0%
I think

00:28:37.520 --> 00:28:39.360 line:0%
the feng shui in the west wing is better.

00:28:39.360 --> 00:28:40.160 line:0%
It brings me more good fortune.

00:28:40.160 --> 00:28:41.690 line:0%
I'll go back and stay there.

00:28:41.840 --> 00:28:42.640 line:0%
Stop.

00:28:50.350 --> 00:28:51.680 line:0%
You don't have a choice.

00:28:53.080 --> 00:28:54.240 line:0%
If you want to die,

00:28:55.760 --> 00:28:57.480 line:0%
you can leave Shen's Mansion.

00:29:05.520 --> 00:29:06.560 line:0%
Fine, I'll stay.

00:29:09.420 --> 00:29:10.680 line:0%
I'm not afraid of it.

00:29:17.760 --> 00:29:19.120 line:0%
Bloodshed?

00:29:19.760 --> 00:29:21.640 line:0%
We'll see who will bleed first.

00:30:08.680 --> 00:30:09.480 line:0%
Madam,

00:30:10.020 --> 00:30:12.280 line:0%
your husband hasn't started eating yet.

00:30:13.750 --> 00:30:14.600 line:0%
So what?

00:30:14.860 --> 00:30:16.120 line:0%
I'm hungry.

00:30:24.690 --> 00:30:26.340 line:0%
It was Second Madam of the Liang family

00:30:26.340 --> 00:30:27.880 line:0%
who caused me to fall into the water today.

00:30:27.880 --> 00:30:29.040 line:0%
Her son died years ago

00:30:29.040 --> 00:30:29.600 line:0%
from the poison

00:30:29.600 --> 00:30:31.200 line:0%
of Water Dropwort.

00:30:31.400 --> 00:30:32.840 line:0%
But now she treats that pot of poisonous plant

00:30:32.840 --> 00:30:34.080 line:0%
like her own child,

00:30:34.080 --> 00:30:35.160 line:0%
calling it Man.

00:30:35.280 --> 00:30:37.040 line:0%
Now, Liang Chenzhong from the first branch

00:30:37.040 --> 00:30:38.800 line:0%
has also been poisoned by Water Dropwort.

00:30:38.800 --> 00:30:40.200 line:0%
What a coincidence, huh?

00:30:47.530 --> 00:30:48.930 line:0%
Don't talk while eating.

00:30:57.400 --> 00:30:58.660 line:0%
I've finished eating.

00:30:59.000 --> 00:31:00.240 line:0%
Do you also think

00:31:00.240 --> 00:31:01.480 line:0%
Liang Chenzhong's death

00:31:01.480 --> 00:31:04.480 line:0%
is revenge from the second branch of the Liang family?

00:31:07.280 --> 00:31:08.280 line:0%
Grand Commander.

00:31:29.160 --> 00:31:29.960 line:0%
Send it away.

00:31:32.080 --> 00:31:32.880 line:0%
Yes.

00:31:36.820 --> 00:31:38.550 line:0%
Why did he leave in such a hurry?

00:31:38.950 --> 00:31:41.010 line:0%
Couldn't he at least finish his meal?

00:31:41.280 --> 00:31:42.280 line:0%
You talk too much.

00:31:44.040 --> 00:31:45.600 line:0%
You're controlling when I eat or drink.

00:31:45.600 --> 00:31:47.690 line:0%
Are you going to control whether I talk or blink as well?

00:31:47.690 --> 00:31:48.640 line:0%
Remember,

00:31:49.280 --> 00:31:50.340 line:0%
in Shen's Mansion,

00:31:51.080 --> 00:31:53.080 line:0%
it's better for you to choose

00:31:54.640 --> 00:31:55.920 line:0%
to be blind and deaf.

00:32:12.060 --> 00:32:13.460 line:0%
The Liang Chenzhong case

00:32:13.920 --> 00:32:15.960 line:0%
has been handed over to the Imperial Security Bureau.

00:32:15.960 --> 00:32:18.680 line:0%
The Ministry of Justice is in charge of this case.

00:32:18.680 --> 00:32:20.410 line:0%
Honey, aren't you very clever?

00:32:20.520 --> 00:32:21.600 line:0%
The Grand Empress Dowager has transferred

00:32:21.600 --> 00:32:22.800 line:0%
this case from the Ministry of Justice

00:32:22.800 --> 00:32:24.280 line:0%
to the Imperial Security Bureau.

00:32:24.280 --> 00:32:25.480 line:0%
Don't you understand

00:32:27.320 --> 00:32:28.720 line:0%
her intention behind it?

00:32:32.480 --> 00:32:35.360 line:0%
The Grand Empress Dowager wants to settle it quietly.

00:32:35.360 --> 00:32:38.840 line:0%
This is because the Liang family holds an important position in the Ministry of Works.

00:32:38.840 --> 00:32:40.680 line:0%
The designs for the crossbows of our country

00:32:40.680 --> 00:32:42.410 line:0%
all come from the Liang family.

00:32:42.440 --> 00:32:44.520 line:0%
Liang Chenman from the second branch died unexpectedly,

00:32:44.520 --> 00:32:46.290 line:0%
and now Liang Chenzhong has suddenly died.

00:32:46.290 --> 00:32:47.960 line:0%
If this family grudge involves

00:32:47.960 --> 00:32:49.370 line:0%
the Third Young Master,

00:32:49.860 --> 00:32:51.000 line:0%
it will inevitably affect the continuation

00:32:51.000 --> 00:32:52.280 line:0%
of the Liang family's legacy in technology.

00:32:52.280 --> 00:32:54.540 line:0%
You're not completely stupid after all.

00:32:54.640 --> 00:32:56.960 line:0%
The second branch of the Liang family can't be imprisoned.

00:32:56.960 --> 00:32:57.760 line:0%
Unless...

00:33:00.190 --> 00:33:02.720 line:0%
you want to oppose the Grand Empress Dowager.

00:33:06.680 --> 00:33:07.580 line:0%
Or is this...

00:33:12.560 --> 00:33:14.520 line:0%
Zhang Xingwei's intention?

00:33:24.000 --> 00:33:25.800 line:0%
I don't work for Minister Zhang.

00:33:29.640 --> 00:33:32.100 line:0%
You left the scroll in the room deliberately

00:33:32.560 --> 00:33:33.960 line:0%
to test me.

00:33:35.300 --> 00:33:37.230 line:0%
You should thank your cleverness.

00:33:37.900 --> 00:33:38.800 line:0%
Otherwise,

00:33:39.440 --> 00:33:41.370 line:0%
you would have already died by now.

00:33:44.960 --> 00:33:46.880 line:0%
Actually, I didn't even need to open it

00:33:46.880 --> 00:33:48.040 line:0%
to guess that

00:33:48.400 --> 00:33:50.330 line:0%
it was the crossbow design inside.

00:33:54.530 --> 00:33:55.730 line:0%
Why are you laughing?

00:33:56.000 --> 00:33:57.000 line:0%
I'm laughing at you.

00:33:57.000 --> 00:33:59.080 line:0%
You, as the Grand Commander of the Imperial Security Bureau,

00:33:59.080 --> 00:34:00.280 line:0%
without verifying,

00:34:00.280 --> 00:34:02.760 line:0%
have already concluded that the murderer is from the second branch of the Liang family.

00:34:02.760 --> 00:34:04.280 line:0%
But the truth may not be so.

00:34:04.840 --> 00:34:07.440 line:0%
The second branch of the Liang family has a grudge against Liang Chenzhong,

00:34:07.440 --> 00:34:08.280 line:0%
but the murderer

00:34:08.280 --> 00:34:09.510 line:0%
only slashed the singer's face

00:34:09.510 --> 00:34:11.370 line:0%
deeply enough to expose the bone.

00:34:12.240 --> 00:34:13.160 line:0%
I've told you,

00:34:14.720 --> 00:34:16.200 line:0%
you don't need to investigate this case.

00:34:16.200 --> 00:34:17.720 line:0%
What if I insist?

00:34:27.950 --> 00:34:30.550 line:0%
You can either remain silent as a living person

00:34:32.600 --> 00:34:33.360 line:0%
or become

00:34:33.360 --> 00:34:34.990 line:0%
a dead one who can't speak.

00:35:13.500 --> 00:35:14.500 line:0%
Grand Commander,

00:35:15.760 --> 00:35:17.020 line:0%
how about we have a bet?

00:35:21.330 --> 00:35:23.530 line:0%
You really aren't afraid I'll kill you.

00:35:24.640 --> 00:35:25.840 line:0%
Of course I'm afraid.

00:35:27.240 --> 00:35:28.440 line:0%
But you also said

00:35:29.160 --> 00:35:30.760 line:0%
that I'm still useful to you.

00:35:33.260 --> 00:35:34.280 line:0%
What?

00:35:35.200 --> 00:35:37.000 line:0%
Are you afraid of losing the bet?

00:35:39.200 --> 00:35:40.000 line:0%
How do we bet?

00:35:41.000 --> 00:35:42.130 line:0%
Let me investigate.

00:35:42.680 --> 00:35:43.560 line:0%
If the murderer

00:35:43.580 --> 00:35:45.520 line:0%
really is Liang Chenyu, the Third Young Master of the Liang family,

00:35:45.520 --> 00:35:46.480 line:0%
you win.

00:35:47.200 --> 00:35:49.280 line:0%
By then, I'll voluntarily ask to be dismissed as your wife,

00:35:49.280 --> 00:35:50.240 line:0%
and my life

00:35:51.720 --> 00:35:53.120 line:0%
will be in your hands.

00:35:56.080 --> 00:35:56.960 line:0%
You really think

00:35:56.960 --> 00:35:58.760 line:0%
your life is too long, don't you?

00:36:00.080 --> 00:36:01.810 line:0%
But if I find the real murderer,

00:36:02.480 --> 00:36:03.610 line:0%
three months later,

00:36:04.560 --> 00:36:05.600 line:0%
we'll divorce.

00:36:08.460 --> 00:36:11.190 line:0%
It's not just you who doesn't want this marriage;

00:36:13.000 --> 00:36:14.260 line:0%
I don't want it either.

00:36:16.830 --> 00:36:18.890 line:0%
We have no grudge against each other.

00:36:19.360 --> 00:36:21.290 line:0%
I don't ask for eternal happiness.

00:36:21.760 --> 00:36:23.690 line:0%
I just want a peaceful separation.

00:36:43.880 --> 00:36:44.680 line:0%
Fine.

00:37:00.880 --> 00:37:01.960 line:0%
No matter what,

00:37:02.400 --> 00:37:04.660 line:0%
I have to get through these three months.

00:37:04.920 --> 00:37:07.180 line:0%
Once the female official examination is over,

00:37:07.180 --> 00:37:08.880 line:0%
the assignment for external duty

00:37:08.880 --> 00:37:10.440 line:0%
should be settled.

00:37:23.640 --> 00:37:25.700 line:0%
It would be a bit inappropriate for me

00:37:25.820 --> 00:37:27.200 line:0%
to stay in the main chamber, wouldn't it?

00:37:27.200 --> 00:37:28.440 line:0%
Just stay here.

00:37:30.440 --> 00:37:31.480 line:0%
Our marriage was bestowed

00:37:31.480 --> 00:37:33.140 line:0%
by the Grand Empress Dowager.

00:37:33.240 --> 00:37:34.440 line:0%
To everyone,

00:37:35.200 --> 00:37:36.760 line:0%
we must appear deeply in love,

00:37:36.760 --> 00:37:37.840 line:0%
inseparable.

00:37:41.400 --> 00:37:43.140 line:0%
If you can't do that…

00:37:43.450 --> 00:37:45.200 line:0%
I will lose my head.

00:37:50.320 --> 00:37:51.800 line:0%
Alright, I got it.

00:37:56.920 --> 00:37:57.800 line:0%
You know what?

00:37:58.080 --> 00:37:59.020 line:0%
I feel like

00:37:59.280 --> 00:38:01.480 line:0%
I really fit in with this main chamber.

00:38:02.880 --> 00:38:04.480 line:0%
Well then, if that's the case,

00:38:04.480 --> 00:38:06.040 line:0%
I want all the treatment that comes with

00:38:06.040 --> 00:38:07.680 line:0%
being the Madam of the household.

00:38:07.680 --> 00:38:10.210 line:0%
To put on a show, you have to do the whole thing.

00:38:13.380 --> 00:38:14.600 line:0%
So I'll sleep there.

00:38:14.840 --> 00:38:16.040 line:0%
Where will you sleep?

00:38:18.020 --> 00:38:19.420 line:0%
Didn't you say so?

00:38:19.980 --> 00:38:20.580 line:0%
Whole,

00:38:20.600 --> 00:38:21.280 line:0%
thing.

00:38:22.660 --> 00:38:24.120 line:0%
We're newlyweds,

00:38:24.200 --> 00:38:25.480 line:0%
inseparable.

00:38:29.040 --> 00:38:30.770 line:0%
We can only sleep together now.

00:38:46.120 --> 00:38:48.520 line:0%
You're in my bed with your outer clothes on?

00:38:52.730 --> 00:38:54.960 line:0%
I've always been like this at home.

00:38:55.190 --> 00:38:57.180 line:0%
Honey, if you're not used to it,

00:38:57.510 --> 00:38:59.370 line:0%
then you'll have to get used to it.

00:39:08.730 --> 00:39:10.000 line:0%
Honey, you're right.

00:39:10.680 --> 00:39:12.340 line:0%
I should indeed get used to it.

00:39:26.170 --> 00:39:27.800 line:0%
You're lying on my hair.

00:39:55.540 --> 00:39:56.720 line:0%
You know what?

00:39:58.050 --> 00:40:00.300 line:0%
These preserved fruits in Shen's Mansion are so delicious.

00:40:00.300 --> 00:40:01.880 line:0%
I can't get enough of them.

00:40:07.160 --> 00:40:08.120 line:0%
Not bad.

00:40:11.680 --> 00:40:12.740 line:0%
Would you like one?

00:40:25.200 --> 00:40:26.150 line:0%
You...

00:40:28.040 --> 00:40:28.840 line:0%
Uncle Zhong!

00:40:29.360 --> 00:40:30.160 line:0%
Change them.

00:40:30.610 --> 00:40:32.960 line:0%
Change them all!

00:40:59.650 --> 00:41:01.110 line:0%
The lights are too bright.

00:41:01.230 --> 00:41:02.520 line:0%
Can we turn them off?

00:41:03.320 --> 00:41:04.120 line:0%
No.

00:41:05.190 --> 00:41:07.120 line:0%
How can I sleep with them so bright?

00:41:08.230 --> 00:41:10.120 line:0%
You don't have to sleep.

00:42:01.320 --> 00:42:02.200 line:0%
Chi,

00:42:03.120 --> 00:42:04.780 line:0%
how have you been in Jiangnan?

00:42:05.840 --> 00:42:06.720 line:0%
Recently, I solved

00:42:06.720 --> 00:42:07.840 line:0%
a wife murder case.

00:42:12.160 --> 00:42:14.080 line:0%
The victim didn't commit suicide.

00:42:14.080 --> 00:42:15.120 line:0%
Let me restore

00:42:15.120 --> 00:42:16.200 line:0%
the scene for you.

00:42:17.160 --> 00:42:17.820 line:0%
Yuanniang.

00:42:18.000 --> 00:42:19.720 line:0%
After you strangled Wang Yuanniang,

00:42:19.720 --> 00:42:21.380 line:0%
you looped the corpse's neck,

00:42:21.560 --> 00:42:22.820 line:0%
dragged it to the beam,

00:42:22.840 --> 00:42:24.120 line:0%
then hung the other end of the rope

00:42:24.120 --> 00:42:25.200 line:0%
on the beam

00:42:25.240 --> 00:42:26.770 line:0%
and pulled hard to hang her.

00:42:27.000 --> 00:42:27.800 line:0%
All of this

00:42:27.800 --> 00:42:29.640 line:0%
left marks on the beam.

00:42:30.880 --> 00:42:31.660 line:0%
So,

00:42:31.920 --> 00:42:33.120 line:0%
there are two strangulation marks

00:42:33.120 --> 00:42:34.520 line:0%
on her neck.

00:42:34.800 --> 00:42:36.040 line:0%
One is black, pointing backwards,

00:42:36.040 --> 00:42:37.760 line:0%
and the other is brown, pointing upwards.

00:42:37.760 --> 00:42:38.480 line:0%
You still have the marks

00:42:38.480 --> 00:42:40.280 line:0%
from the hemp rope on your hands.

00:42:40.520 --> 00:42:41.920 line:0%
She was strangled to death by you.

00:42:41.920 --> 00:42:42.680 line:0%
Miss Yan,

00:42:43.840 --> 00:42:45.480 line:0%
Ms. She has already confessed

00:42:45.480 --> 00:42:47.080 line:0%
that she assisted Cheng Xian

00:42:47.120 --> 00:42:48.520 line:0%
in the murder of his wife.

00:42:48.800 --> 00:42:51.240 line:0%
This small garment was embroidered by Yuanniang, wasn't it?

00:42:51.240 --> 00:42:52.720 line:0%
According to the coroner's examination,

00:42:52.720 --> 00:42:53.520 line:0%
Wang Yuanniang

00:42:53.520 --> 00:42:55.160 line:0%
was two months pregnant.

00:42:55.360 --> 00:42:56.960 line:0%
You're trying to deceive me!

00:42:59.920 --> 00:43:01.200 line:0%
Even if she was pregnant,

00:43:01.200 --> 00:43:02.360 line:0%
so what?

00:43:03.040 --> 00:43:04.280 line:0%
You were resentful about marrying into her family

00:43:04.280 --> 00:43:05.760 line:0%
and killed Wang Yuanniang in anger.

00:43:05.760 --> 00:43:06.880 line:0%
But you didn't know

00:43:06.880 --> 00:43:08.640 line:0%
that she had been deeply in love with you

00:43:08.640 --> 00:43:10.400 line:0%
and had already planned to have the child

00:43:10.400 --> 00:43:12.130 line:0%
take your surname after birth.

00:43:12.160 --> 00:43:14.220 line:0%
The embroidery on this small garment

00:43:14.320 --> 00:43:15.520 line:0%
is the surname Cheng.

00:43:17.120 --> 00:43:18.500 line:0%
[Cheng]

00:43:19.400 --> 00:43:20.920 line:0%
You always blame Wang Yuanniang's maternal family

00:43:20.920 --> 00:43:21.960 line:0%
for oppressing you,

00:43:21.960 --> 00:43:24.290 line:0%
but you know the truth better than anyone.

00:43:25.280 --> 00:43:26.480 line:0%
Yuanniang,

